* Task 4 fixture: FIND data-access extraction
* Contains FIND statements interleaved with READ and STORE
* to prove FIND reads are extracted with normalized names and NameRange,
* and source-order interleaving is preserved.

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 ISN (P9)
  1 NAME (A30)
END DEFINE

READ DEPARTMENTS

FIND EMPLOYEES WITH NAME = 'SMITH'

STORE EMPLOYEES

FIND (3) VEHICLES

END

